              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2776,
                "end_index": 2948,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "These were giant stars powered not by fusion, but by a rapidly growing black hole at their core, which quickly swallowed the surrounding star to become a supermassive giant"
