              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2963,
                "end_index": 3160,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Intermediate-Mass Black Holes (Runaway Collisions)\nIntermediate-mass black holes are the \"middle children\" of the cosmos, ranging from hundreds to hundreds of thousands of times the mass of the Sun"
