                "text": "* **Globular Cluster Collisions:** Recent observational evidence, including ripples in spacetime (gravitational waves) detected by facilities like LIGO, suggests these form in the dense hearts of **globular clusters**\u2014highly crowded \"neighborhoods\" of stars"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
